<title>POLAND: PPAB DEC NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPAB DEC NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.20 vs    0.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.73 vs    0.80</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.51 vs    2.73</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 4.98 vs    3.90</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  9.05 vs    3.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   15.63 vs    7.01</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 41.90 vs   24.35</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	53.82 vs   34.20</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy Polsko</p>
<p>Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
